      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I have the requirements for Story 14 and 15:\nStory 14: Add credentials for an InvenioRDM instance.\n- Account settings configuration.\n- Display available InvenioRDM instances.\n- Validate tokens.\n- Notify on invalid/valid tokens.\n- Explain benefits of providing tokens.\n\nStory 15: Remove credentials for a configured InvenioRDM instance.\n- Remove token.\n- Notify on success.\n- Show that instance is no longer configured.\n\nNow I will read `AssociatedDatasetsDemoV2.java` to see how the current demo is structured.",
